1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Defral. A loan that defends itself.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Rina borrowed $6,000

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,000
against $10,000 of tokenized Treasury.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
When price dips, there's a 2,000 bps window

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
between the guard trigger and liquidation.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
That window is the only job of the reserve.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
She was asleep.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
This is the live position on Base Sepolia.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The agent is armed and watching.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Every number here was read from the vault contract.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Not recomputed. Not estimated.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The reserve stays in your wallet.

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Setting it is an approve, not a transfer.

14
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,500
Two zero-argument calls.

15
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:02,000
The contract knows what to do.

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
No parameters, no destinations.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,500
Trigger at 130%.

18
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,500
Target at 145%.

19
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:15,000
Max repay: 2,000 dUSD per event.

20
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The publisher key is separate from the agent key.

21
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The agent cannot push prices — only respond to them.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Price dropped to fifty-nine cents.

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Health ratio: 11,500 basis points.

24
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The defence window is open.

25
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:47,000
The agent fired automatically.

26
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Open the Logs tab — that's where the proof lives.

27
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
From is the KeeperHub relayer.

28
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The action ran as an internal call.

29
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Health: 11,500 to 14,500.

30
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Landed exactly on target.

31
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,000
The proof page reads a JSON archive

32
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
committed to this repository.

33
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
The deployer of this entire system —

34
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,000
the address that owns the pool

35
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,000
and holds every admin key — was refused.

36
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,000
NotAgent. That's on the demo vault itself.

37
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Permanent. You can click it.

38
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
KeeperHub declines to broadcast

39
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,000
a call it predicts will revert.

40
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,000
This is the execution record.

41
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The agent moved other people's money

42
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,000
through gates it cannot widen, and kept none.

43
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Agent EOA: zero dUSD.

44
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,000
No withdraw function. We never held it.

45
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Defral.

46
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:25,000
It never becomes a liquidation.

47
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:30,000
github.com/alventendrawan123/defral
